===== A: no key -> key required by default =====
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" http://127.0.0.1:19090/admin/api/info
401
$ lsof -nP -iTCP:19090 -sTCP:LISTEN
restitch 38744 nathananderson-tennant   20u  IPv4 0x78dd9ffc25e892eb      0t0  TCP 127.0.0.1:19090 (LISTEN)
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" http://127.0.0.1:19090/metrics
200

===== B: admin.enabled: false -> port closed =====
$ curl -s --max-time 2 http://127.0.0.1:19091/admin/api/info
(exit 7)
log: admin server disabled by config","enabled":false

===== C: keyed admin, C4 OPTIONS check =====
$ curl -X OPTIONS -H "Origin: https://evil.example" /admin/api/reload (no key)
401
$ curl -X OPTIONS -H "Origin: https://good.example" -H "X-Admin-Key: admin-secret-1" (with key)
204
$ curl -H "X-Admin-Key: admin-secret-1" /admin/api/info
200

